Automatic technical scan for BIST 30 stocks: EMA sequence signals (short 5-8-13-21, medium 34-55, long 89-144),
Wave Trend oscillator and 60-day regression channel position. Channel position %0=lower band, %100=upper band means;
above 100% shows price exceeding the upper band (overbought), below 0 shows price falling below the lower band.
Pearson (r) shows the direction/strength of the trend over the last 60 days (negative r indicates downward price trend;
signal is based only on direction indicators).

